stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> started
    started --> exporting: configuracion valida
    exporting --> polling: export creado
    polling --> downloading: status completed
    polling --> failed: failed o timeout
    downloading --> raw_saved: carga RDZ OK
    downloading --> failed: descarga/carga falla
    raw_saved --> resolving: token obtenido
    resolving --> normalizing: referencias procesadas
    normalizing --> normalized_saved: carga DDZ OK
    normalized_saved --> completed: sin errores por fila
    normalized_saved --> completed_with_errors: invalid_format o API errors
    normalized_saved --> failed: marcador o control falla
    completed --> watermark_updated
    completed_with_errors --> watermark_updated
    watermark_updated --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
